{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aabc53374a4ccff65331aa8810e8493a916e81ea59e99daa6a6be377fc752405",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78be2494823c828cc358f1862e394a16125e7258fdc89ac1b0f7e01b2eda3b96",
      "text": "……没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529081c01cee2082c8c4bee05fd9fcd8fedf3999cbcf475f44b8186837fa6a42",
      "text": "没必要隐瞒。\n你的眼力有多好，老祖母也是认可的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06a1be513d162ebaa0fdf8c51347ccbc9b7ebe503461da723fd31b356e5de1c1",
      "text": "但是……看透一切、\n守护葛之叶之名与血脉的是女人们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58e2006f84018a276d4e5c74aff27d40b515728c2199526910f707cbf7692838",
      "text": "母亲之后，迟早由你妹妹来继承这个家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38430db2da2b59649753f248a484b3569b403db59685a8fe4f624c543371be09",
      "text": "我们这些男人们的工作……是清扫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0bce12506200d77cf0a669cfece54d270206cfb1aa129b3da60be17045a0b9",
      "text": "雨彦。用那份力量，今后也\n好好辅佐母亲她们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3838b2dd172c46e65e5b6102ede5b14b591de319ec312e8c963825155baec6ae",
      "text": "……啊。交给我吧，老爹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b715071ac0334075be61604ba432776caf7f0b0b62a77aad56703d66fd8b6e9f",
      "text": "老妈作为葛之叶的当家，\n老爹作为男丁全心全意地辅佐着她。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84066deabbb6bfbc145e2fe6fe9cd4622e188883909ce509bf9d51f3a949a3a9",
      "text": "对自己的职责抱有自豪，\n作为清扫屋努力工作的你的身姿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc69a8d6095d7dfca5060e27df21ca7b37918abca12b9bf4a5d2825d28884fef",
      "text": "一直以来，都是我的目标。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
